<div class="gap-bottom-equal edu-about-area about-style-9" style="background:#0060ff2e; padding: 60px 10px;">
    <div class="container edublink-animated-shape">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <div class="about-content">
                    <div class="section-title section-left sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">

                        <h2 class="title">Why Study in the USA?</h2>
                        <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>

                    </div>
                    <ul class="features-list sal-animate" data-sal-delay="150" data-sal="slide-up" data-sal-duration="800">
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            For World-Class and Quality Education
                            <p class="fs-5">Study at prestigious institutions globally renowned for academic excellence. Benefit from advanced facilities, cutting-edge research, and expert faculty.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Globally Accepted Degrees
                            <p class="fs-5">Your degree will be recognized and highly valued by employers and academic institutions across the globe. This opens doors to international job markets and opportunities for advanced studies anywhere you choose.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Flexible Education System
                            <p class="fs-5">Customize your academic journey with diverse course options and flexible program structures. This allows you to tailor studies to your passion and goals, exploring subjects before committing.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Higher ROI on Your Investment
                            <p class="fs-5">Your educational investment yields high returns. Graduates often achieve higher earning potential, faster career progression, and a powerful professional network, ensuring long-term financial success.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Excellent Support for International Students
                            <p class="fs-5">Universities offer comprehensive support for international students. Dedicated services like academic advising, career counseling, visa help, and personal well-being support ensure a smooth, successful study experience.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Flexible Scholarship Programs
                            <p class="fs-5">Access diverse scholarship programs to fund your education. These opportunities, based on merit or need, make prestigious universities more affordable for international students seeking financial support.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Study and earn simultaneously
                            <p class="fs-5">Legally work part-time during your studies. This helps cover living expenses, provides valuable work experience, and eases financial strain, all while maintaining your academic focus successfully.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Experience Vibrant Campus Life
                            <p class="fs-5"> Immerse yourself in a dynamic campus environment. Enjoy diverse clubs, sports, and social events for personal growth, networking, and cultural engagement beyond academics.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Multicultural Experiences
                            <p class="fs-5"> Interact with diverse students globally. This broadens your worldview, enhances cross-cultural communication skills, and builds valuable international networks, preparing you for an interconnected world.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li style="text-align: left; font-weight: 600;">
                            Diverse Career Opportunities
                            <p class="fs-5"> Your international degree unlocks diverse global career paths. Access wide-ranging internships and job fairs, gaining highly valued skills. This significantly expands your professional horizons worldwide.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <img src="~/assets/images/usa/1.jpg" style="border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 2px #6d6d6d;" alt="Study Abroad USA" title="Study Abroad USA" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>



